						shby: '白仪',
						shby_info: "①当一名角色即将受到<span style='color: #0000FF'>雷电</span><span style='color: #FF7D40'>伤害</span>时,你可以防止该<span style='color: #FF7D40'>伤害</span>.②<span style='color: #E3CF57'>准备阶段</span>,若游戏轮数为5的整数倍,你可以对至多X名角色造成Y点<span style='color: #0000FF'>雷电</span><span style='color: #FF7D40'>伤害</span>(X为你的<span style='color: #00FF00'>体力值</span>,Y=游戏轮数÷5)",
